      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CASH THE LOT (7) quickly into stride and found the front, leading until late when second (24.07) at this track in a Grade 5 over 425m. Winning claims. DR. ZAIDEN (8) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (22.88) at Warragul. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. One of the better chances. IT'S OKAY (3) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at The Meadows over 525m behind Paw Iowa (30.64) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Warrants plenty of respect. BUFFALO COWBOY (1) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
